## 🎨 Quick tweaks you might enjoy

| Want | How |
|------|-----|
| Dark‑mode toggle | Add a CSS class on `<body>` and swap background colors. |
| Live bot stats (CPU, RAM) | Create an endpoint (`/api/bot/metrics`) that your bot pushes to (e.g., via a tiny Express route). |
| Better UI | Swap the CSS for **Tailwind** or **Bootstrap** – just change the `<link>` tag. |
| Auto‑refresh | `setInterval(() => loadDashboard(token), 30000);` in `app.js`. |

